# Paths the Semgrep workflow does not scan (WP83, ADR-0045). Semgrep reads this file from the scan root; it replaces
# Semgrep's built-in defaults, so build output and dependencies are listed here too.
# Build output, caches, dependencies
**/target/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/node_modules/
.mvn/
# Generated Dart API clients (just gen-api; their source of truth is libs/contracts, scanned as OpenAPI only)
apps/web/packages/
# Test code and test fixtures: deliberate secrets, raw SQL and insecure set-ups belong there (SAST covers shipped code)
**/src/test/
apps/web/test/
apps/web/integration_test/
apps/web/test_driver/
e2e/
.semgrep/tests/
# Helm templates are Go templates, not YAML (rendered charts are checked by deploy/helm/tests and trivy config)
deploy/helm/**/templates/
# Vendored third-party web assets (sqlite3 wasm, drift worker build output), not our code
apps/web/web/sqlite3.wasm
apps/web/web/drift_worker.js
